# 公共子过程：主页 → 退出 → 回到登录页
#
# 流程：主页点菜单 → 菜单点退出 → 二次确认弹窗点「登录」→ 回到登录页

def _exit_to_login()
    # 1. 主页 → 菜单
    click [game_main_page].[menu]
    wait (1, 2)

    # 2. 菜单 → 退出
    click [game_menu_page].[exit]
    wait (1, 2)

    # 3. 二次确认：在 check_right 区域找「登录」按钮
    find [game_main_page].[check_right] as $confirm by contains "登录"
    if $confirm
        click $confirm
    end
    wait (2, 3)
end
